<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Encryption Demo</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --success: #16a34a;
            --bg: #f4f7fb;
            --card: #fff;
            --border: #e5e7eb;
            --text: #1f2937;
            --muted: #6b7280;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .info {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        input,
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 140px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        button {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        button:hover {
            opacity: .95;
        }

        .result {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .result h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .code {
            background: #111827;
            color: #22c55e;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            word-break: break-all;
            font-family: monospace;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .note {
            margin-top: 25px;
            background: #ecfdf5;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--success);
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>

</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">

            <div class="header">
                <h1>🔒 Encryption Demo</h1>
                <p>See how your content is protected before it is stored.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content">

                <div class="info">
                    This page demonstrates how end-to-end encryption works. The text below will be encrypted using your
                    personal encryption key before being saved to the database. Only someone with the same key can
                    decrypt it.
                </div>

                <form method="POST">

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Title</label>
                        <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="Example: My Secret Journal" value="{{ result.name }}">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Private Content</label>
                        <textarea name="content" placeholder="Write something confidential...">{{ result.content }}</textarea>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit">
                        Encrypt & Save
                    </button>

                </form>

                <div class="result">

                    <h3>What gets stored in the database</h3>

                    <div class="code">
                        8b4f51d4efea56d76a4f3fb0bd3f11e73f7e7b5cbfb637eb16f7d77ab5d5b6dc1a21db37e3e96238abfef47295cfd3e4c4c62d9f2d782f2ea1d3d3b01f3f87c7...
                    </div>

                    <p style="margin-top:15px;">
                        Instead of your original text, only encrypted ciphertext is stored. Without your encryption key,
                        this data cannot be converted back into readable content.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="note">
                    <strong>Privacy Guarantee</strong>

                    <ul style="margin-top:10px;padding-left:20px;">
                        <li>Your encryption key is never stored in the database.</li>
                        <li>Your key exists only during your current login session.</li>
                        <li>Administrators cannot read your encrypted content.</li>
                        <li>Direct database access reveals only encrypted data.</li>
                        <li>If you lose your encryption key, encrypted content cannot be recovered.</li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>